		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Ghostly helmed warrior. Uneasy soul of the righteous.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 17 (plate mail + shield), <strong>HP</strong> 24, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 longsword +3 (1d8) or curse, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> -4, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 5</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Curse</strong>. Curse a lawful mortal within near to find fallen's remains and give last rites. WIS 15+ or cursed, cannot rest.</p><p></p><p><strong>Greater Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Incorporeal</strong>. In place of attacks, become corporeal or incorporeal.</p><p></p><p><strong>Rejuvenation</strong>. If destroyed, reforms in 2d4 days</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
